    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This merciless and reckless warrior has led the Ketra Orcs for many years. A born gambler, he prefers direct action to elaborate plans, and personally leads his troops from the front line when attacking. He has faced Varka's Commander Mos twice, winning one of the contests, and is eager for a rematch. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
